{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27058","headline":"句 · 姚合","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天遥来鴈小，江阔去帆孤。\n南陌游人回首去，东林道者杖藜归。\n萄藤洞庭头，引叶漾盈摇。\n皎洁钩高挂，玲珑影落寮。\n阴烟压幽屋，蒙密梦冥苗。\n清秋青且翠，冬到冻都凋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27058.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27058","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}